ind":"announcement","title":"Custom Maps & Steam Workshop Added!","summary":"Custom Maps & Steam Workshop Added!Custom map creation and Steam Workshop support have now been added to Stewart The Fox: Swing it! ahead of launch on January 14, 2027.At release, players will be able to build their own levels with spawn points, finishes, swing points, wall-jump sections, and more. Maps can be published directly to Steam Workshop, updated later, and played in-game after subscribing to any map.Happy creating!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T19:20:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4479090-1842212951304268","game_id":"steam-4479090","kind":"announcement","title":"Sweat Your Ass Off in Baron's Chase! Can You Escape?","summary":"BARON VON FLAPPENSTEIN IS ON THE HUNT! Baron's Chase is a brand-new endless mode where your goal is simple: survive for as long as possible. RUN. SWING. DON'T GET CAUGHT. Run, swing, and wall jump through an endless course while Baron chases you from behind. Make a mistake and he'll start closing the distance. Get too slow, and you're getting carried away! The longer you survive, the faster Baron becomes. Your survival time is recorded on the Steam leaderboard, so every second counts. How long c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T20:08:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4479090-1836506165565894","game_id":"steam-4479090","kind":"announcement","title":"Stewart The Fox: Swing it! Demo Available Now","summary":"The free demo for Stewart The Fox: Swing it! is no